<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Community Launch Checklist</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Community Launch Checklist</h1>
<h2>Pre-Launch</h2>
<ul><li>[ ] Platform selected and configured (channels/spaces set up)</li><li>[ ] Welcome flow designed (what happens when someone joins)</li><li>[ ] Initial content seeded: 5-10 conversations planted before first invitation</li><li>[ ] Community guidelines written and posted</li><li>[ ] Moderation plan documented (who, when, escalation path)</li><li>[ ] First 50 invitation list finalized (existing engaged contacts only)</li><li>[ ] Three core rituals defined with cadence</li></ul>
<h2>Launch Week</h2>
<ul><li>[ ] Personal welcome sent to each new member within 48 hours</li><li>[ ] First daily ritual established and running</li><li>[ ] At least one engagement post per day from you</li><li>[ ] All questions and posts responded to within 4 hours</li><li>[ ] Feedback collected from early members on what to improve</li></ul>
<h2>First Month</h2>
<ul><li>[ ] 3+ rituals running consistently</li><li>[ ] Member introduction thread active (new members introducing themselves)</li><li>[ ] First member-generated content (member posted unprompted)</li><li>[ ] Community guidelines refined based on first moderation decisions</li><li>[ ] 3-5 ambassador candidates identified (most active, most helpful)</li><li>[ ] Health metrics baseline established (DAU/MAU, post rate, retention)</li><li>[ ] First ritual variation applied (same structure, different wording)</li></ul>
</body></html>
